cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "steering-with-clear-eyes"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark of activation steering methods against object presence
  hallucination in vision language models, which evaluates every method on the
  same items through the official scorer of each benchmark and reports the
  hallucination removed next to the general capability lost.
